2026Friday, May 29, page 3
Friday Science and Technology Learning Course How you learn is important
Today, everyone in the workforce realizes the need to acquire advanced science and technology and is committed to learning..Administrative and economic workers as well as government officials are generously devoting their time to learn advanced science and technology..
The problem is not only if you dedicate time and energy, but also if you learn one thing, you will be knowledgeable., You need to learn it so you can use it in real business..
In reality, we can see workers who seem to study hard, but their level of science and technology does not increase significantly and they do not get many jobs..this is not strange at all.
This is an inevitable phenomenon that occurs in people who are unable to learn science and technology in a practical way and only imitate it in a superficial way..
On the other hand, there are workers who do not have a deep understanding of advanced technologies and previous experiences, and who know only superficially, but praise themselves that it is okay to stop, and bring their own false claims to the guidance process..
Even if you study in depth for 100 nights, the reality is that there are many unknown problems in the business process..However, how well can you do if you go to the field and provide guidance with knowledge and skills that have not been steadily developed?.
It is highly unlikely that innovative results will be achieved in a place with such workers..
The party consistently emphasizes that workers have professional qualifications and high skills..
Today, in the era of science and technology, the word “just roughly” can never be used in improving the practical skills of workers..
Workers who are passionate about learning science and technology should pause for a moment and objectively evaluate their own learning methods and effectiveness..
Am I learning science and technology effectively?, Have I been caught up in formalism without even knowing it?.
What is lacking? We often hear that some workers are unable to properly learn science and technology due to lack of time..
Of course, it is true that workers who have heavy duties and a lot of work to do are busier than anyone else..However, if we just wait for the time to pass, how can we raise our scientific and technological capabilities to the level that the party wants?.
In fact, whether or not you make time to acquire scientific technology depends entirely on your own enthusiasm and is not a job-related issue..
If we look around us, there are countless workers who save time and study hard despite being busy..
２０２２Just looking at the workers who received excellent evaluations in the political practical ability evaluation held during a special training session for workers in the party life guidance department of the organization department of each level of the party committee of the Workers' Party of Korea in July 2018, there is not a single worker with extra time left..Rather, I am busier than other people and don't have enough time..
The question is, what perspective do you have and with what zeal do you stick to it?.
polymath, If you look at the workers who are called talented people, they all consider improving practical skills as a vital issue that depends on the fate of their unit and party policy, and they do not put down their books even in their free time..
As times progress, the demand for a group of scientific and technological skills is increasing..
It is clear that if we fail to keep pace with this trend and continue to waste time, the party will never be able to reach the desired heights..
what is lacking.
This is a question of the times that workers who are unable to pay due attention to improving their skills must ponder again..
What is actually lacking?, Is it time or enthusiasm??
Headquarters reporter Lee Ho-seong
